        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5006-450, 4-1/2\" x 4-1/2\" Door Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis full mortise hinge is for heavy weight and high traffic doors. It has a 5 knuckle design and button tip pin and plug. BHMA certified architectural grade hinges. The 4-1/2 x 4-1/2 Five Knuckle Full Mortise Hinge, has a non-rising removable pin. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BOM-bb5004-specifications.gif?v=1704442281\" width=\"465\" height=\"214\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Bommer BB5006-450 Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Stainless Steel Bommer BB5006-450 Full Mortise Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.180\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer Hinges made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</b>\r\n</p>",
